\section{Summary\secrule}




\begin{onecolentry}
	% \hspace{1cm}  Researcher at Western Washington University combining biology and computer science to investigate biological phenomena. Using computational biology in the Lee lab to study small RNAs and genome integrity in \textit{Tetrahymena thermophila}. Seeking a career in translational molecular biology research at the intersection of cancer, immunology, and neurodegenerative disease.
	\hspace{1cm} Molecular and computational biologist with experience in Western blots, PCR, and sterile cell culture, as well as genomic analysis. Experience in investigating RNA interference pathways in \textit{T. thermophila} and protein degradation pathways in \textit{C. elegans}. I am seeking a laboratory technician position to apply these molecular and computational skills to immunology and cancer research.
\end{onecolentry}








